{"object_id": "demo:3619", "kind": "demo", "text": "其实仔细想想这些地域黑言论，主要都是河南山东和东北，这些还都是粮食大省，微博知乎上都有很多地域黑，就是不断的损毁这些省份的声誉，我是河南人，身边有很对东北同学，我觉的人很好啊，没什么可黑的，室友就是山东的也特别好，真的不知道那些黑子的经历是怎么来的，我遇见的这些省份的人都觉的很好，到黑子嘴里就是十恶不赦了", "text_sha256": "43c310d9c901b4e7179af80e49fd586e19e1cbe261b53e900ba76eda35333a2d", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 4, "values": {"hate": "non-hate", "group": ["Region"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "annotations/labels-04.json", "sha256": "b5299959711d8308255469621bef59aeba7e951b24374a391083587ba16d8766"}}}
