{"object_id": "demo:3701", "kind": "demo", "text": "我不喜欢黑人，第一点是，是审美上的问题。第二点是，他们刻在骨子里的懒惰，与不安分。第三点是，他们没有国家认同感，对他们再好，他们也觉得自己是落叶，只知道索取第四点是，他们没有民族荣誉感，他们不会为了民族而斗争。可以慢慢同化，但是要多少时间与代价？？", "text_sha256": "26a10526e73293b76f77d71a4c6afce2997434f57ff0e597bc3683b8bdd02554", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 4, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Racism"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "annotations/labels-04.json", "sha256": "b5299959711d8308255469621bef59aeba7e951b24374a391083587ba16d8766"}}}
