{"object_id": "demo:3749", "kind": "demo", "text": "微博发声的最大声是女拳，讲道理女拳如果不是说那些骇人听闻的反人类的言论，而是正能量的讲这么改变，谁喷你可能还成为主流思想呢，毕竟在中国女性在言论上还是受保护的。打嘴炮那些不算呀，如果硬要算那么低端我也没话说。是女性自己不争取正确价值观，让女拳这样妖魔橫行，而女拳要的条件是政府和人类不可能接受的，也就是说不会改变什么，占着位置不做事。", "text_sha256": "e9dbb1a9b22eeaa03f43777c5dd4f4e9d559b65df23e24fabc2897bba1f00a17", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 4, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Sexism"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "annotations/labels-04.json", "sha256": "b5299959711d8308255469621bef59aeba7e951b24374a391083587ba16d8766"}}}
{"object_id": "demo:3784", "kind": "demo", "text": "还是不一样的。首先，在非洲的中国人几乎都算当地土豪，土豪享有优先交配权很正常，国内土豪也没少玩。其次，那帮渣男不会因为有个非洲对象就有优越感，更不会因此贬低国内女人。相反，有国外对象的女人明里暗里秀优越，贬国男，甚至当二鬼子的可太多了。", "text_sha256": "e7ea45d0c592c70fcdf53d5014a26861ffb78b695a5975a0249d3707072a2e5f", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 4, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Region", "Sexism", "others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "annotations/labels-04.json", "sha256": "b5299959711d8308255469621bef59aeba7e951b24374a391083587ba16d8766"}}}
